cs, a service parts management solution; and FlexPLM, a platform for merchandising and line planning, materials management, sampling, and others. In addition, it offers Kepware, an enterprise industrial connectivity solution; Kepware Edge, a Linux-based industrial communications platform; KEPServerEX, an industrial connectivity solution for small projects; Creo, a 3D CAD technology enables the digital design, testing, and modification of product models; and Onshape, a SaaS product development platform that delivers computer-aided design with data management, collaboration tools, and real-time analytics. Further, it offers Vuforia, an augmented reality (AR) software; and Arbortext, a dynamic publishing solution streamlines how organizations create, manage, and publish technical documentation. Additionally, the company provides PTC Products; PTC Mathcad; and augmented reality product. PTC Inc. was incorporated in 1985 and is headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts.","employees":7000,"website":"https://www.ptc.com","country":"United States","city":"Boston","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Neil  Barua","title":"President, CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Aaron C. Von Staats Esq.","title":"Executive VP, Chief Legal Officer, General Counsel & Corporate Secretary"},{"name":"Ms. Catherine A. Kniker","title":"EVP, Chief Marketing & Sustainability Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.06,"tpe":28.84,"ps":5.684,"pfcf":30.12,"peg":0.92,"pb":7.047,"ev_ebitda":19.42,"rev_growth":0.205,"eps_growth":0.5,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2707,"eps_growth_next":0.1945,"div_yield":0.0013,"roe":0.2332,"roa":0.08596,"de":47.52,"gross_margin":0.5932,"op_margin":0.2293,"profit_margin":0.1856,"current_ratio":1.518},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":19.61,"sector":17.06,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":21.94,"sector":28.84,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":7.811,"sector":5.684,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":null,"s